  "author": "Ibnurustamaji",
  "description": "The great palace Pura Mangkunegara is home to the king, along with his family with the traditional Javanese house concept. The Great Pura Mangkunegara villa has a traditional Javanese house style, but has a mix of European culture in some parts. \nPura Mangkunegara is a private home of KGPAA Mangkunegara family built by KGPAA Mangkunegara I or Raden Mas Said or Prince Samber Nyawa. Pura Mangkunegara appeared as a result of the signing of the \"Perjanjian Salatiga\" by Pakubuwana II, VOC, Hamengkubuwana III and Raden Mas Said.",
  "date": "2018-01-31 14:32:19",
  "credit": "Own work",
  "attributionRequired": "true"
 },
